    skos:definition "ISRIC Report 2019/01: Tier 1 and Tier 2 data in the context of the federated Global Soil Information System. Appendix 3,ISRIC Report 2014/01: Africa Soil Profiles Database Version 1.2. Annex 3a",
        "Total humic carbon represents the stable fraction of soil organic matter derived from humified materials. It improves soil structure, nutrient retention, and water-holding capacity, making it critical for long-term soil health and productivity. Source: Stevenson, F.J. (1994)." ;
